[page mode=document title="About — Neon City"]
  [heading level=1 fg=yellow]About Neon City BBS[/heading]
  [hr style=dash fg=yellow /]
  [spacer lines=1 /]

  [box border=rounded fg=yellow w=55 title="What Is This?"]
    [text]Neon City is a terminal-native BBS running on the ATP (ANSI Terminal Protocol). It serves pages written in AML — a markup language designed for terminals.[/text]
    [spacer lines=1 /]
    [text]No web browser needed. No JavaScript. No tracking. Just your terminal and a connection.[/text]
  [/box]

  [spacer lines=1 /]

  [heading level=2 fg=bright-yellow]How ATP Works[/heading]

  [text]The protocol is simple:[/text]
  [spacer lines=1 /]

  [list style=number]
    [item][text]Client connects and sends [text bold fg=cyan]HELLO[/text] with capabilities[/text][/item]
    [item][text]Server replies with [text bold fg=cyan]WELCOME[/text][/text][/item]
    [item][text]Client sends [text bold fg=cyan]GET /path[/text] for each page[/text][/item]
    [item][text]Server replies with [text bold fg=cyan]PAGE[/text] containing AML content[/text][/item]
    [item][text]When done, either side sends [text bold fg=cyan]BYE[/text][/text][/item]
  [/list]

  [spacer lines=1 /]
  [text dim]Connections are persistent — multiple pages over one connection, like HTTP keep-alive.[/text]

  [spacer lines=1 /]

  [heading level=2 fg=bright-yellow]Server Info[/heading]

  [table border=single]
    [thead]
      [tr][th]Property[/th][th]Value[/th][/tr]
    [/thead]
    [tbody]
      [tr][td]Software[/td][td fg=cyan]Dustnet v0.1[/td][/tr]
      [tr][td]Protocol[/td][td fg=cyan]ATP 1.0[/td][/tr]
      [tr][td]Default Port[/td][td fg=cyan]1985[/td][/tr]
      [tr][td]Encryption[/td][td fg=cyan]TLS 1.3 (rustls)[/td][/tr]
      [tr][td]Content[/td][td fg=cyan]AML (ANSI Markup)[/td][/tr]
    [/tbody]
  [/table]

  [spacer lines=1 /]

  [heading level=2 fg=bright-yellow]AML Features[/heading]

  [text]Pages can contain:[/text]
  [list style=bullet]
    [item][text]Styled text (bold, italic, colors, hex colors)[/text][/item]
    [item][text]Boxes with borders (single, double, rounded, heavy, ASCII)[/text][/item]
    [item][text]Tables, lists, headings, horizontal rules[/text][/item]
    [item][text]Row/column layouts[/text][/item]
    [item][text]Links to other ATP pages[/text][/item]
    [item][text]Interactive panels with state switching[/text][/item]
    [item][text]Frame-based animations[/text][/item]
    [item][text]Reusable components (macros)[/text][/item]
    [item][text]Preformatted text and ASCII art[/text][/item]
  [/list]

  [spacer lines=1 /]

  [heading level=2 fg=bright-yellow]Contact[/heading]

  [text]SysOp: [text bold fg=bright-white]@neon_admin[/text][/text]
  [text dim]This site is open source. Contributions welcome.[/text]

